[{"id":"cnm_h144_q1","topicId":"cnm_h144","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪一项符合空间向量的含义？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"只有长度、没有方向的量"},{"key":"B","text":"既有大小又有方向的量"},{"key":"C","text":"只有位置、没有大小的点"},{"key":"D","text":"一条不标方向的线段"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"向量要同时有大小和方向。不标方向的线段不是向量。","verify":"\"既有大小又有方向的量\""},{"id":"cnm_h144_q2","topicId":"cnm_h144","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(1，0，0)，b=(2，0，0)。两个向量方向相同，|b| 是 |a| 的几倍？","answer":"2","explanation":"模分别是 1 和 2，所以 |b| 是 |a| 的 2 倍。方向相同但模不同，两个向量不相等。","verify":"2"},{"id":"cnm_h144_q3","topicId":"cnm_h144","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"零向量的模是多少？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"等于 1"},{"key":"B","text":"等于任意非零向量的模"},{"key":"C","text":"没有确定的模"},{"key":"D","text":"等于 0"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"零向量长度是 0，方向不定，模确定为 0。","verify":"\"等于 0\""},{"id":"cnm_h144_q4","topicId":"cnm_h144","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"A(0，0，0)，B(0，3，0)。有向线段 AB 对应向量的纵坐标是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"终点纵坐标减去起点纵坐标：3−0=3。","verify":"3"},{"id":"cnm_h145_q1","topicId":"cnm_h145","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(1，0，2)，b=(3，4，−1)。a+b 的横坐标是多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"坐标分别相加，横坐标是 1+3=4。","verify":"1+3"},{"id":"cnm_h145_q2","topicId":"cnm_h145","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(2，−1，4)，b=(2，3，1)。a−b 的竖坐标是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"竖坐标相减：4−1=3。","verify":"4-1"},{"id":"cnm_h145_q3","topicId":"cnm_h145","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(1，−2，3)。3a 的纵坐标是多少？","answer":"-6","explanation":"数乘时每个坐标都乘 3，纵坐标是 3×(−2)=−6。","verify":"3*(-2)"},{"id":"cnm_h145_q4","topicId":"cnm_h145","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"空间向量的加法适合用哪一种法则？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"只能把坐标全部相乘"},{"key":"B","text":"三角形法则或平行四边形法则"},{"key":"C","text":"只能用于共面的零向量"},{"key":"D","text":"两个向量相加一定得到零向量"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"空间向量加法仍可用三角形法则或平行四边形法则，和平面向量一样。","verify":"\"三角形法则或平行四边形法则\""},{"id":"cnm_h146_q1","topicId":"cnm_h146","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(1，2，2)，b=(2，0，1)。a·b 等于多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"数量积是对应坐标相乘再相加：2+0+2=4。","verify":"1*2+2*0+2*1"},{"id":"cnm_h146_q2","topicId":"cnm_h146","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(1，0，−1)，b=(2，5，2)。a·b 等于多少？","answer":"0","explanation":"2+0−2=0，两个向量垂直。","verify":"1*2+0*5+(-1)*2"},{"id":"cnm_h146_q3","topicId":"cnm_h146","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"两个非零空间向量的数量积等于 0，说明什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"两个向量平行"},{"key":"B","text":"两个向量垂直"},{"key":"C","text":"两个向量模相等"},{"key":"D","text":"两个向量一定是零向量"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"非零向量数量积为 0，夹角余弦为 0，夹角是直角。","verify":"\"两个向量垂直\""},{"id":"cnm_h146_q4","topicId":"cnm_h146","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(3，1，0)，b=(1，1，4)。a·b 等于多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"对应坐标相乘再相加：3+1+0=4。","verify":"3*1+1*1+0*4"},{"id":"cnm_h147_q1","topicId":"cnm_h147","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(2，3，6)。|a| 等于多少？","answer":"7","explanation":"模等于坐标平方和的算术平方根：√(4+9+36)=√49=7。","verify":"isqrt(2*2+3*3+6*6)"},{"id":"cnm_h147_q2","topicId":"cnm_h147","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(1，2，2)，b=(2，1，−2)。a·b 等于多少？","answer":"0","explanation":"数量积是 2+2−4=0，所以夹角是直角。","verify":"1*2+2*1+2*(-2)"},{"id":"cnm_h147_q3","topicId":"cnm_h147","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"a·b>0 且 a、b 都不是零向量时，夹角是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"直角"},{"key":"B","text":"钝角"},{"key":"C","text":"锐角"},{"key":"D","text":"一定是 0 度"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"数量积等于 |a||b|cosθ。模为正，数量积为正，则 cosθ>0，夹角是锐角。","verify":"\"锐角\""},{"id":"cnm_h147_q4","topicId":"cnm_h147","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(0，3，4)。|a| 等于多少？","answer":"5","explanation":"√(9+16)=√25=5。","verify":"isqrt(0+9+16)"},{"id":"cnm_h148_q1","topicId":"cnm_h148","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"b=(2，4，−6)，a=(1，2，−3)。若 b=λa，λ 等于多少？","answer":"2","explanation":"每个坐标都是 a 的 2 倍，所以 λ=2，两个向量共线。","verify":"2"},{"id":"cnm_h148_q2","topicId":"cnm_h148","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"a=(1，0，2)，b=(2，0，4)。这两个向量的位置关系是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"垂直但不共线"},{"key":"B","text":"既不共线也不垂直"},{"key":"C","text":"共线"},{"key":"D","text":"一定垂直"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"b=2a，所以共线。数量积 2+0+8≠0，并不垂直。","verify":"\"共线\""},{"id":"cnm_h148_q3","topicId":"cnm_h148","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(1，2，k)，b=(2，4，6) 共线。k 等于多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"坐标成比例：1/2=2/4=k/6，所以 k=3。","verify":"3"},{"id":"cnm_h148_q4","topicId":"cnm_h148","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"零向量与任意空间向量是否共线？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"共线，因为 0=0·a"},{"key":"B","text":"只有与单位向量才共线"},{"key":"C","text":"一定不共线"},{"key":"D","text":"只有在坐标轴上才共线"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"零向量等于任意向量乘 0，所以与任意向量共线。","verify":"\"共线，因为 0=0·a\""}]
